        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to create a Python script that publishes a JSON event to a managed messaging topic or queue using a concrete external provider. I will choose Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS) as the external provider for this task. The script will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use it to publish messages to an SNS topic. </thinking>\n",
